checks_run.procedure:
On a fresh disposable stack, create a transformation and walk Diagnose→Define→Design with synthetic data. The checks cover:
- the B0018 role texts;
- the B0009 modes;
- the B0023 gate names, and G2/G3 refused before G1 and G3 refused before G2;
- the charter's 14 fields with versions;
- the composed four-part B0037 thesis, flagged incomplete when a part is blank or invisible;
- the five scope checks verbatim;
- T01 with H/M/L confidence;
- 10 TOM dimensions with the B0056 questions;
- the six B0029 workstreams and the B0062 canvas prompts;
- exactly one current North Star;
- the 3-5 top-outcome warning;
- the good-outcome test failing 'Launch new app';
- G2 blocked at zero guardrails;
- G3 blocked without gap matrix, capability gaps and future journeys;
- unquantified value pools labelled;
- the submitter cannot decide.
Then the G1, G2 and G3 demo decisions advance the phase, and Arabic charter text with RLM marks is stored verbatim.

On the same stack, check:
- T04 (B0065, seven columns, codes D-nn);
- T03 (six columns, dimension required);
- the capability heatmap linked to a gap;
- decimal journey cycle time;
- pain points linked to T01;
- workshop items converting to T04 only with an owner;
- the per-dimension TOM view.

Rerun my D-068 (round-8), D-067 and D-066 live API probes as regressions:
- raw UTF-8 Arabic/emoji/RLM verbatim, and BOM;
- invalid bytes refused with validation.json;
- Arabic query strings;
- undecodable queries;
- lone surrogates;
- malformed URLs.

In Chromium, in AR and EN:
- invisible-only, default-ignorable-only and spaces-only charter values give the inline localized blank message with aria-invalid, and nothing is sent;
- a visible value is created verbatim;
- the thesis shows Incomplete;
- an invisible Out of scope edit writes no version;
- the round-6/7 UI regressions: Arabic+emoji+RLM created verbatim, and lone surrogates and NUL refused client-side.

Static review of the candidate:
- the D-069 diff (cf3446e4..7854770e) touches no i18n, seed, migration or methodology file, and media-types.ts / RecordForm.tsx / problem.ts have no domain effect;
- the web client still sends JSON and octet-stream only;
- B0009 and B0023 text is verbatim;
- no PMI or certification claim;
- #0078FF is provisional;
- no float types in migrations;
- no DG0-DG7 product gate code.

Check the environmental residuals on their offline or config surface only, as the assignment directs:
- D-057 live registry: an offline frozen-lockfile install;
- D-058 live CI: the two ci.yml copies are identical;
- D-049 Keycloak: the image pin and its recorded blocked digest.
